        </div>
        <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-6xl font-black text-white leading-tight mb-8">
          Best Bathroom Dehumidifiers <span class="text-[#38BDF8]">and When You Need a Fan Instead</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-8 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
          Five dehumidifiers matched to the bathroom they can actually handle, from a powder room to a windowless main bath, with an honest look at why the exhaust fan is the first fix and the tiny plug-in units are often the last.
